  "dek": "rellik13 jumped from 29th to 20th at 37.97, one hundredth below the provisional gold line, while NVARC3 moved from tenth to seventh and Yi-Chia Chen trimmed Tufa Labs' lead.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-3 Early edition: rellik13 lands a hundredth of a point from gold as NVARC3 climbs to seventh. rellik13 jumped from 29th to 20th at 37.97, just 0.01 below SparseTech's 37.98, the last provisional gold place. NVARC3 moved from tenth to seventh at 45.90, up 1.96 overnight. Yi-Chia Chen improved to 67.77, trimming Tufa Labs' lead from 1.42 to 1.14 at 68.91. Medal bands are provisional. https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-22-morning-arc-3",
  "edition": "morning",
  "generatedBy": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
  "headline": "rellik13 lands a hundredth of a point from ARC-3 gold as NVARC3 climbs to seventh",
  "id": "2026-10-22-morning-arc-3",
  "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T10:50:30Z",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "One hundredth short of gold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "rellik13 produced the overnight board's most consequential move. A score event lifted the entry from 36.55 to 37.97 and from 29th to 20th, leaving it a single hundredth of a point below SparseTech, who hold the nineteenth and last provisional gold place at 37.98. The jump pushes Tong Hui Kang, the 20th-place entry at 37.92 in the previous Late edition, down to 21st, and insuperabilehart sits 22nd at 37.39. The gold line itself did not move, so the next small advance by rellik13, Tong Hui Kang or insuperabilehart would change who holds a medal place. These public medal bands remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "NVARC3 moves up three places",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "NVARC3 rose from tenth to seventh overnight, lifting its mark from 43.94 to 45.90, a gain of 1.96. The move carried it past artificialagencylab.com at 45.41, the Japanese-named 復活の混テキスト at 45.11 and Majkel1337 at 44.84, each of whom slipped one place to eighth, ninth and tenth. Grigoriy Zatravkin remains sixth at 47.19, 1.29 ahead of NVARC3. Team Turducken, mtg and the last dance held third, fourth and fifth at 52.82, 50.37 and 49.85."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The summit narrows slightly",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs still leads at 68.91, a score the board has carried unchanged for more than a week. Yi-Chia Chen, second, improved from 67.49 to 67.77 with an event overnight, trimming the gap at the top from 1.42 to 1.14. The top two remain nearly 15 points clear of third place, and Team Turducken's 52.82 is unchanged."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Overnight climbers below the gold line",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Several large jumps filled the middle of the board. RanJeet Gupta rose from 749th to 204th at 32.50, above the provisional silver cutoff of 32.24. RR 606d went from 1,672nd to 307th at 31.69 and Bin Han from 2,250th to 308th at 31.67, both above the bronze line at 30.89 but short of silver, while Vikram Tiwari moved from 1,310th to 496th at 30.75. Андрей Рябов climbed from 448th to 240th at 32.16, 0.08 below silver. Score events are context rather than net daily gains, and the social scan was not refreshed for this edition, so the account rests on the public board."
    }
  ],
